                <p>Source: National Archives, RG 59, Central Files
                    1964–66, POL 23–9 THE CONGO. Secret; Immediate; Limdis. Drafted by Schaufele in AF/CWG; cleared by Hughes,
                    McElhiney in AF/CWG, and Ball; and
                    approved by Tasca. Also sent to
                    Leopoldville and Nairobi.</p>
            </note>
